WEBVTT

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:08.040
This is so much fun!

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:09.330
Yeah, I can't wait!

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:13.660
There's no Internet and I can't watch anime...

00:00:14.330 --> 00:00:18.540
Why the heck did I have to come to a place like this?

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:19.080
The general purpose of the school camping trip:
-Cultivate the spirit of the love of nature
-Independence, cooperation
- Encourage social awareness

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:21.410
I want to go home soon.

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:24.910
I want to go home and continue my game!

00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:31.910
No matter how much I think about it,
I can't come up with a single good thing...

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:33.870
BAM!

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:37.200
What're you doing?!

00:00:37.290 --> 00:00:40.540
Why are you slacking off?! We're not done cleaning yet!

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:44.250
So you won't let me take a little break?!

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:46.870
We're gonna finish this quickly and then go chill.

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:54.660
Ishino, I'm done with this room.

00:00:54.870 --> 00:00:56.660
This room is finished too!

00:00:56.660 --> 00:00:58.290
Sorry, I'm not done with this one yet.

00:00:58.450 --> 00:01:00.620
What? Where's Takanashi?

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:05.410
Why... am I here?

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:08.410
Because you owe me.

00:01:09.830 --> 00:01:14.830
At any rate, this is a wonderful lodge.
I'm happy that you invited me!

00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:18.870
When you showed up with that intense cosplay,
I didn't know what to do, though...

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:20.500
Everyone's
dressed
casually...

00:01:19.910 --> 00:01:23.620
I thought we'd surely have to do
some survival activities and the like...

00:01:25.910 --> 00:01:30.080
Ah, she's laughing. I'm glad we invited Ayado along.

00:01:30.830 --> 00:01:34.700
Okay, everyone, let's hurry up and finish this
then make some food!

00:01:36.370 --> 00:01:40.000
Ichiban daijin a koto wa
The most important thing

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:44.160
Daremo shiranai koto nanda
Is something nobody knows

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:48.250
Are mo kore mo daijina you de
Things which may be considered important

00:01:48.410 --> 00:01:51.790
Toki ga sugireba kiete yuku
May fade away as time goes by

00:01:51.870 --> 00:01:59.580
Kaze ni notte kumo no kirema ni
Romance in pale pink

00:01:59.950 --> 00:02:05.950
Tadayou no wa omoide no you na
Like the palm of a hand which has begun to color

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:15.290
Irozuki hajimeta te no hira no you na
Riding on the wind

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:21.950
Usubeni iro no koigokoro
Just like memories drifting in the break in the clouds

00:02:23.830 --> 00:02:27.330
Toki wo kakenuke yagate kuru
The new season will come soon

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:33.290
Atarashii kisetsu yume to wa sukoshi chigau
Leaping through time

00:02:33.290 --> 00:02:36.790
Tada oboeteiru koto wa
And it's little different from a dream

00:02:36.790 --> 00:02:42.700
Daijina koto nanda
But the things I remember are very important

00:02:44.540 --> 00:02:48.410
Ichiban daijina kotoba
The most important words

00:02:48.410 --> 00:02:52.500
Daremo iwazuni owarisou
May never be said to anybody

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:56.450
Are mo kore mo daijoubu sa
Everything will be all right

00:02:56.450 --> 00:03:00.410
Toki ga sugitemo oboeteru
Even though time passes, I will remember

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:04.290
Anata no koto wa oboeteru
I will remember you

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:08.750
Alright, food time!

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:12.450
About How Camping Was a High-Level Event for Me.

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:09.950
We're going hunting, right?

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:13.080
We've gotta do something beastly somehow, don't we?

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:14.000
Huh?

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:16.080
I bought some food so we don't have to...

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:17.620
Darn your gamer brains!

00:03:17.790 --> 00:03:18.500
Huh?

00:03:18.580 --> 00:03:21.160
How to Light Charcoal

00:03:19.290 --> 00:03:23.910
We're gonna be making some barbecue,
so, who here can cook?

00:03:24.450 --> 00:03:25.830
I can only make sweets.

00:03:26.870 --> 00:03:30.500
Takanashi, you're a boy that cooks?! And you, Igarashi?

00:03:30.830 --> 00:03:33.500
I'll go pick some edible plants or something.

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:34.540
No, it's okay!

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:37.200
I'll wash! I'll help with the washing!

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:38.000
You're hired.

00:03:38.410 --> 00:03:41.040
Then Igarashi and Tsutsui will set up the table!

00:03:41.620 --> 00:03:43.700
Everyone else will prepare the ingredients!

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:48.580
You're really fast.

00:03:48.580 --> 00:03:50.330
Y-you think so?!

00:03:50.700 --> 00:03:55.000
Even at my home I make a lot of vegetables
so it's just that I'm used to it.

00:03:55.160 --> 00:03:56.790
Oh? Even at home?

00:03:56.950 --> 00:04:01.910
Plus, i-it's like everything's been amplified,
and it's crazy that I'm cooking in the wild!

00:04:01.910 --> 00:04:05.580
I get it! I'm just peeling the skin but I'm enjoying it, too!

00:04:12.700 --> 00:04:16.620
The two of us are kinda like
an old married couple, aren't we?

00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:17.290
Huh?

00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:21.200
Takanashi, do you really not have a girlfriend?
Is there someone you like?

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:21.910
No.

00:04:22.160 --> 00:04:23.540
Well, how about me?

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:26.250
Sorry, Ishino, but you're not my type at all.

00:04:28.290 --> 00:04:31.290
It's okay not to give that quick of a response, you know.

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:32.660
S-sorry, it just-

00:04:32.660 --> 00:04:36.290
For future reference, tell me what you don't like.

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:37.700
I feel no sexual attraction.

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:39.370
You seem like a pain in the ass.

00:04:39.830 --> 00:04:40.870
You seem two-faced.

00:04:42.250 --> 00:04:43.410
I'm sorry!

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:47.080
Blargh! It's no use, I'm unattractive.

00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:49.370
Don't show your true character so clearly.

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:53.790
Here's the meal! Eat it while it's hot!

00:04:54.250 --> 00:04:55.830
Alright, I'll help myself then...

00:04:56.540 --> 00:04:58.500
Let's eat!

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:02.040
Delicious!

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:04.450
Ayado, you did a great job!

00:05:04.790 --> 00:05:06.410
I-I'm glad you like it!

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:10.330
Huh? What's wrong?

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:14.660
I'm sorry... it was just so fun!

00:05:14.950 --> 00:05:17.790
I get it! I feel a bit like I'm gonna cry too!

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:19.870
Me too. This is fun.

00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:24.540
You know, with you guys, this is the type of thing
that I just cannot get into sometimes.

00:05:24.540 --> 00:05:25.750
I know, right...

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:35.040
D-do you want me to wash these instead?

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:36.870
Put it over there, please.

00:05:40.370 --> 00:05:43.330
Y-you hate me, don't you?

00:05:43.330 --> 00:05:44.750
Of course I do.

00:05:45.540 --> 00:05:47.660
You did that awful thing to Tsutsun.

00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:53.160
It was foul and unfair, and I despise you
from the bottom of my heart.

00:05:53.660 --> 00:05:55.580
I told you I was sorry about that.

00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:59.040
Honestly, I didn't know it would go like it did.

00:05:59.330 --> 00:06:01.910
At first I didn't care what happened to that guy.

00:06:02.450 --> 00:06:05.200
But now... I think he's not so bad.

00:06:06.200 --> 00:06:11.000
Since I'm well aware of my pride,
I'm not gonna tell him that,

00:06:11.450 --> 00:06:15.790
but the times where I can agree with you and him
dating happen more often than they did before.

00:06:16.290 --> 00:06:19.700
I told you that I don't need you to agree with it.

00:06:22.660 --> 00:06:27.160
You attempting to defend yourself to the very end
is something I'll never forgive.

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:33.160
Well, we've come all the way here, so even if
I'm in a bad mood there's nothing we can do about it.

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:39.160
Huh? I can't catch anything at all, though...

00:06:39.160 --> 00:06:41.370
You'll definitely catch something, the next one is yours!

00:06:39.160 --> 00:06:41.370
Everyone got so obsessed as soon as
they rented a fishing pole.

00:06:41.370 --> 00:06:43.660
Everyone got so obsessed as soon as
they rented a fishing pole.

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:45.500
I caught something!

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:47.250
Wow, that's your third one!

00:06:47.450 --> 00:06:50.500
Ayado, how are you so capable of doing everything?

00:06:50.620 --> 00:06:52.500
Huh?! Not everything...

00:06:53.290 --> 00:06:55.450
It's just that my father likes fishing.

00:06:55.910 --> 00:06:59.250
As you can see, I'm a below-average nothing of a girl.

00:06:59.540 --> 00:07:01.870
You don't seem like that at all, though.

00:07:10.370 --> 00:07:14.080
I thought she just tended to the vegetables
at school and got caught up in her emotions,

00:07:14.080 --> 00:07:18.500
but she's been a maid, and she's
great at cooking, and she can fish...

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:22.750
I've never seen such a mysterious girl.

00:07:40.250 --> 00:07:42.250
I caught something weird!

00:07:42.250 --> 00:07:44.290
Whoa! Stay away from me!

00:07:44.290 --> 00:07:46.410
Hey, it's dangerous to go too far tha-
You can catch something like this here?!

00:07:51.290 --> 00:07:52.830
It's so warm.

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:54.660
Dammit.

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:56.040
I said I was sorry!

00:07:56.200 --> 00:07:58.950
Ishino, you like to throw people in the river, huh?

00:07:58.950 --> 00:08:00.410
I said it wasn't on purpose!

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:02.410
I threw YOU in on purpose, though.

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:04.870
Now, now, the fish are ready!

00:08:05.120 --> 00:08:07.120
You have some too, Cat Ear-senpai!

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:10.200
Thanks. Um, Ayado?

00:08:10.330 --> 00:08:11.080
Yes?

00:08:11.700 --> 00:08:14.580
Can you stop with the "Cat Ear-senpai" soon?

00:08:14.580 --> 00:08:15.870
Oh, I'm sorry!

00:08:17.660 --> 00:08:21.120
It's "Ito-senpai," right? I'm sorry.

00:08:23.450 --> 00:08:24.950
N-no...

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:27.750
I'm going to go get some water.

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:42.250
After all this time, I finally understand...

00:08:43.450 --> 00:08:46.830
Do you think it's okay
for someone like me to like someone?

00:08:48.330 --> 00:08:50.700
How Tsutsui felt at that time...

00:08:51.540 --> 00:08:53.660
The feeling of coming to like someone...

00:08:54.910 --> 00:08:57.370
It's like some organ of mine is going to explode...

00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:04.000
Tonight, maybe I'll try to talk to Tsutsui.

00:09:06.790 --> 00:09:07.870
H-hey!

00:09:07.870 --> 00:09:10.200
How about some cards?! Cards?!

00:09:10.200 --> 00:09:14.250
That sounds good! You still can't sleep, right?!
Even though we took a bath!

00:09:14.250 --> 00:09:16.370
Because it's only eight o'clock...

00:09:16.370 --> 00:09:17.950
I'm not playing cards, though.

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:19.620
Then how about a pillow fight?!

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:22.790
Can you please stop trying to reclaim your youth here?

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:25.160
I'm done with you being mean, Ishino!

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:28.580
I'm going to get the sweets!
I made them yesterday and brought them here!

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:30.700
I'll go make some tea!

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:36.830
They're in such high spirits!
Don't you think it was worth it to come along?

00:09:37.450 --> 00:09:41.660
Tsutsun is honestly enjoying himself... I'm glad.

00:09:41.660 --> 00:09:44.000
What about you, Igarashi? Are you having fun?

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:45.200
Huh?

00:09:45.200 --> 00:09:47.000
Well, I'm sorry about that.

00:09:47.370 --> 00:09:51.160
You've helped me out so much,
but I couldn't go to the same trouble for you.

00:09:52.790 --> 00:09:56.790
I-I'm sorry! You don't have to go to any trouble for me!

00:09:57.040 --> 00:09:59.500
No, I'm thinking that I really didn't...

00:09:59.500 --> 00:10:01.040
It's completely okay!

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:07.700
Ayado is a good person,
and she's genuinely having fun today.

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:10.290
Thanks, Ishino.

00:10:10.410 --> 00:10:11.580
No problem.

00:10:13.370 --> 00:10:16.040
Oh man... I'm sleepy...

00:10:20.250 --> 00:10:21.370
What happened?!

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:22.830
I-I'm sorry...

00:10:25.540 --> 00:10:26.830
Ayado!

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:29.330
Ito! Get some ice from the cooler!

00:10:29.330 --> 00:10:31.200
Huh? Uh, right!

00:10:31.700 --> 00:10:32.750
Does it hurt?

00:10:32.750 --> 00:10:34.250
N-no.

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:43.620
Th-thank you!

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:49.000
I brought the... ice.

00:10:49.200 --> 00:10:50.870
Your hand is still red.

00:10:50.870 --> 00:10:52.370
I'm okay, already!

00:10:52.370 --> 00:10:54.830
I just touched a little bit of hot water...

00:10:55.040 --> 00:10:57.160
I'm sorry that I was so loud.

00:10:59.500 --> 00:11:01.160
There's medicine, do you want to use it?

00:11:05.290 --> 00:11:06.950
Here's the ice.

00:11:07.830 --> 00:11:08.660
Huh?!

00:11:10.200 --> 00:11:11.580
Tsutsui, ice!

00:11:11.580 --> 00:11:12.580
Right.

00:11:18.700 --> 00:11:20.160
Do you want to put some ointment or something on it?

00:11:36.540 --> 00:11:38.750
What are you doing, Ito?

00:11:39.200 --> 00:11:41.080
I could ask you the same thing, Igarashi...

00:11:44.370 --> 00:11:48.000
Igarashi, is there something you're worried about?

00:11:48.250 --> 00:11:49.910
No, what do you mean?

00:11:49.910 --> 00:11:51.870
Wow, that poker face...

00:11:52.040 --> 00:11:55.080
You took a deep breath earlier, right? It was strange.

00:11:55.080 --> 00:11:59.120
Will you act like you didn't see that? What about you, Ito?

00:11:59.540 --> 00:12:04.870
Yeah, maybe... it's something I can't tell anyone either.

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:09.580
Something's off, right?
Since we're having this kind of conversation...

00:12:12.450 --> 00:12:15.200
You two should get in here, you'll catch a cold.

00:12:15.410 --> 00:12:17.410
You're right. Wanna go back?

00:12:17.580 --> 00:12:20.950
I'll come in after I get a little bit more air out here.

00:12:21.040 --> 00:12:22.000
Okay.

00:12:27.120 --> 00:12:28.290
Did something happen?

00:12:28.750 --> 00:12:29.540
Nope.

00:12:30.500 --> 00:12:31.410
I see.

00:12:42.040 --> 00:12:43.410
Ishino.

00:12:43.410 --> 00:12:44.700
You know...

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:49.580
You normally play it cool
in order to keep yourself together,

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:52.660
but it's extremely difficult to pry with people like that.

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:55.450
But you've been thoroughly prying, haven't you?

00:12:55.450 --> 00:12:56.160
Right!

00:12:56.160 --> 00:12:58.120
That's because I dare to pry!

00:12:58.120 --> 00:13:02.250
I now think that I'm truly the only one
who can read the vague changes in your mood.

00:13:02.250 --> 00:13:04.000
So talk about it.

00:13:04.370 --> 00:13:05.830
Okay then, shall I guess?

00:13:08.330 --> 00:13:12.700
You're feeling uncertain about Tsutsui,
but there's no way you can express that.

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:16.620
And that's because it isn't anyone's fault.

00:13:17.200 --> 00:13:20.620
If you get mad at the innocent one, you seem petty.

00:13:21.910 --> 00:13:24.580
Hey! Don't run away because I hit the nail on the head!

00:13:25.040 --> 00:13:27.910
If you don't like it, it's okay to say something!
You're his girlfriend!

00:13:30.500 --> 00:13:31.450
But...

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:38.500
Before, when I told him not to talk to that girl,
things got really weird.

00:13:38.620 --> 00:13:41.700
That's because you've been bottling it up
for so long and you let it explode, right?

00:13:41.700 --> 00:13:45.450
If you don't say it on the spot every time,
things will get weird again.

00:13:48.830 --> 00:13:51.370
Hey, wanna play cards?

00:13:51.370 --> 00:13:53.080
So you decided to in the end, huh?

00:13:56.330 --> 00:13:58.000
Hey, you were peeking!

00:13:58.000 --> 00:13:59.410
I was not peeking.

00:13:59.410 --> 00:14:00.950
Okay, I win.

00:14:00.950 --> 00:14:02.000
Objection!

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:04.540
You definitely saw them when I was
turned towards the stove just now!

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:04.540
No one is actually enjoying this
except for Takanashi and Tsutsui.

00:14:04.540 --> 00:14:07.200
Even if I did, that's your own fault.

00:14:04.540 --> 00:14:07.200
No one is actually enjoying this
except for Takanashi and Tsutsui.

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:09.660
And everyone took the time to come here...

00:14:12.250 --> 00:14:15.080
Enough! We're done! Screw this game!

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:17.450
What controlled violence you're showing...

00:14:17.450 --> 00:14:19.540
I think you did that because you pulled the Joker.

00:14:19.700 --> 00:14:21.450
Um, guys...

00:14:22.830 --> 00:14:27.580
I'm feeling a little bit fever-ish,
so is it alright if I go ahead and go to bed?

00:14:27.580 --> 00:14:28.450
What?!

00:14:29.910 --> 00:14:31.410
For real! You're warm!

00:14:31.580 --> 00:14:33.080
Please don't worry.

00:14:33.080 --> 00:14:35.500
Isn't it because Ishino threw you in the river?

00:14:35.500 --> 00:14:38.750
I just thought that, but I couldn't say it!

00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:40.410
I'm sorry, Ayado!

00:14:40.660 --> 00:14:43.950
No... I've always easily caught colds.

00:14:44.330 --> 00:14:46.250
I think I'll get better if I sleep.

00:14:47.540 --> 00:14:49.870
Shin Lalaa
A
tablets

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:02.620
There's still a slight fever.

00:15:03.950 --> 00:15:07.450
Earlier, when Tsutsun held Ayado's hand...

00:15:08.120 --> 00:15:13.750
I'd be lying if I said it didn't bother me,
but that's not really the problem.

00:15:15.830 --> 00:15:18.080
That guilty look on her face...

00:15:18.910 --> 00:15:20.580
Igarashi-senpai...

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:23.370
I'm sorry.

00:15:23.620 --> 00:15:25.160
Oh, I thought you weren't sleeping.

00:15:25.450 --> 00:15:26.410
I wasn't...

00:15:29.540 --> 00:15:35.080
I was always thinking I should return this,
but I still wanted to hold onto it.

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:43.790
Because at that time, when you came running to me
and treated me so kindly... I was so, so happy.

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:47.620
It's fine. I told you that you don't have to give it back.

00:15:47.620 --> 00:15:49.660
But I can't do that! I-

00:15:49.660 --> 00:15:50.750
I said it's fine!

00:15:53.370 --> 00:15:54.750
I'm sorry.

00:15:56.580 --> 00:15:58.080
I...

00:16:12.040 --> 00:16:15.450
Is Ayado okay? Sorry I had you check up on her.

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:17.830
Sorry? But why?

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:18.620
Huh?

00:16:18.950 --> 00:16:21.160
Why are you apologizing, Tsutsun?

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:22.870
Uh... no...

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:25.830
If you're going to apologize,
you should just go check on her, right?

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:27.450
But... That's...

00:16:29.750 --> 00:16:31.500
Something strange is going on with you.

00:16:32.910 --> 00:16:33.870
Uh... hey...

00:16:33.870 --> 00:16:35.080
It's nothing.

00:16:35.700 --> 00:16:37.500
You don't cry over things that are nothing!

00:16:37.500 --> 00:16:38.620
I said it's nothing!

00:16:38.620 --> 00:16:39.450
Hey!

00:16:39.450 --> 00:16:42.160
It's your fault things are like this, you idiot!

00:16:47.580 --> 00:16:49.040
W-wait!

00:16:49.040 --> 00:16:50.080
Don't follow me!

00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:53.790
Ah, Ishino! She's...

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:57.700
So you made her freakin' cry, finally?! You idiot!

00:16:57.700 --> 00:16:59.250
Hey... What a-

00:16:59.250 --> 00:17:02.080
So you're never gonna stop trying
to be an idiot, is that it?!

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:05.950
Ishino... things you can fix
by hitting them don't really exist these d-

00:17:05.950 --> 00:17:08.700
Whatever! Just hurry up and go after her!

00:17:11.290 --> 00:17:15.200
If you don't say it on the spot every time,
things will get weird again.

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:21.450
It's cold...

00:17:22.500 --> 00:17:25.910
So dense. I've had enough of it.

00:17:26.200 --> 00:17:29.870
But it isn't Tsuntsun's fault. I mean, I...

00:17:30.080 --> 00:17:33.080
I came to love him because of that kindness.

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:38.370
I don't understand anymore. I'm so confused!

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:42.200
Where did she go?

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:43.370
She isn't over here.

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:44.250
Or here.

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:47.000
What do we do? It gets cold at night...

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:48.950
What are you doing?

00:17:48.950 --> 00:17:52.160
I don't know. Something else I feared has happened...

00:17:52.870 --> 00:17:55.620
She got hurt again without me realizing it.

00:17:55.870 --> 00:17:58.580
Ah, yeah, uh-huh, that's you.

00:17:58.580 --> 00:17:59.250
What?!

00:17:59.250 --> 00:18:00.500
For your information,

00:18:00.790 --> 00:18:04.750
someone who means well is worse off than someone
who KNOWS that what they're doing is bad.

00:18:04.750 --> 00:18:08.620
Wha-?! But, she never tells me anything, though!

00:18:08.620 --> 00:18:10.950
Igarashi is probably tired of it too.

00:18:10.950 --> 00:18:13.700
I mean she has to tell you every single thing
or you won't understand...

00:18:15.000 --> 00:18:18.620
N-now isn't the time for the two of you to attack me!
I'm gonna go find her!

00:18:19.500 --> 00:18:22.040
You idiot! You aren't even familiar with this place!

00:18:22.040 --> 00:18:23.160
Give me the flashlight!

00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:29.040
Huh? Igarashi-senpai is... missing?!

00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:31.660
This is my fault.

00:18:31.660 --> 00:18:33.410
What? Did something happen?

00:18:33.700 --> 00:18:35.870
Well, I told her...

00:18:36.540 --> 00:18:41.290
I said... that I love Tsutsui-senpai.

00:18:41.910 --> 00:18:43.660
I told Igarashi-senpai that.

00:18:44.620 --> 00:18:48.410
Hey, did you have to say that at a time like this?

00:18:49.120 --> 00:18:51.200
I mean, you're out here hanging out with everyone.

00:18:51.330 --> 00:18:55.000
I'm sorry! I felt like I had to let her know!

00:18:55.290 --> 00:18:57.080
I couldn't keep quiet forever.

00:18:58.830 --> 00:19:01.540
You sure do have a lot of nerve, surprisingly.

00:19:01.540 --> 00:19:03.540
Are you trying to get between these two?

00:19:03.660 --> 00:19:04.830
No way!

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:09.120
I really don't think you're one to talk, Takanashi!

00:19:11.160 --> 00:19:14.790
Well, since it seems like those two
are unexpectedly fragile...

00:19:15.620 --> 00:19:17.080
It's way too tactless.

00:19:17.410 --> 00:19:18.830
Hey!

00:19:18.830 --> 00:19:20.450
Igarashi!

00:19:20.450 --> 00:19:22.120
Where are you!

00:19:23.120 --> 00:19:24.290
She isn't here...

00:19:25.910 --> 00:19:28.660
Hey! Don't you start looking like you're gonna cry!

00:19:28.660 --> 00:19:29.580
Ouch!

00:19:29.580 --> 00:19:32.330
You've been resorting to violence
a whole lot lately, Ishino!

00:19:32.330 --> 00:19:35.160
I'm sorry about that! I just get so pissed
whenever I look at you.

00:19:35.160 --> 00:19:39.450
Huh? Is it that bad? Have I been that hopeless today?

00:19:39.620 --> 00:19:44.790
That's not what I'm saying,
but do you really not understand anything?

00:19:45.160 --> 00:19:46.290
I don't know...

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:50.870
Can I confide in you a bit, Ishino?

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:52.910
Huh? That's scary, all of a sudden.

00:19:53.290 --> 00:19:57.790
When I was in junior high,
I spent the entire school camping trip alone...

00:19:57.790 --> 00:19:59.750
This IS a scary story!

00:19:59.870 --> 00:20:05.910
So I have no good memories whatsoever,
and that's why I felt uneasy coming here.

00:20:07.040 --> 00:20:09.620
But today was so much fun.

00:20:11.450 --> 00:20:16.160
I'm thinking that I want to
really cherish everyone who is with me now.

00:20:16.950 --> 00:20:22.080
Of course Igarashi and Ito,
but as for you and Ayado and Takanashi,

00:20:22.580 --> 00:20:27.120
this time for sure, everyone who is with me,
even though I'm like this,

00:20:27.410 --> 00:20:29.750
I want to make sure I cherish you all.

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:34.830
But as soon as I thought that, this happened.
What do I do?

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:38.500
How do you think you were trying
to show that to Igarashi?

00:20:42.870 --> 00:20:44.620
In any case, let's keep moving!

00:20:45.410 --> 00:20:47.160
He quit thinking about it...

00:20:53.120 --> 00:20:56.290
There's no way you know how people feel, right!

00:20:56.290 --> 00:21:00.120
Since you've always avoided getting involved with people
aren't you super good at ignoring everything?

00:21:02.370 --> 00:21:09.410
I never quite understand her emotions,
but somehow I know well that I missed the mark.

00:21:10.450 --> 00:21:16.040
Will I keep on unknowingly
hurting her like this from now on?

00:21:36.290 --> 00:21:40.750
Yume ga same sora nagamete omou
I wake from a dream and gaze at the sky

00:21:41.250 --> 00:21:46.080
Mune wo utsu ano kotoba kirei da
And think of those beautiful words that touched my heart

00:21:46.290 --> 00:21:50.450
Uwabe kazarazu hanasetara na...
If only I could talk to you without putting on airs...

00:21:51.000 --> 00:21:55.950
Sobietatsu fuan no tou ga
Is the pillar of fear towering above it all

00:21:57.330 --> 00:22:00.330
Ari no mama de ii no kana??
Okay just the way it is?

00:22:00.910 --> 00:22:05.580
Nan oku kounen nayameba ii no darou??
For how many millions of light-years must I suffer??

00:22:05.830 --> 00:22:08.750
Saa sugu doa akete
Come on, open the door now

00:22:08.910 --> 00:22:10.830
Ai ni yukou
And let's meet

00:22:10.830 --> 00:22:15.750
Imi nado nai yo hotondo ga
Most of it means nothing, you know

00:22:16.330 --> 00:22:20.250
Kimi ni sokkou de minukareru no osorete
The fear that you immediately see through me

00:22:20.950 --> 00:22:25.450
Koukai bakari da ne futari wa kitto
Fills me with regret, surely

00:22:25.450 --> 00:22:30.500
Zutto miageteta sora wa sotto
The sky that we always stared up at, quietly

00:22:30.500 --> 00:22:35.410
Bokura no asu wo terasu kitto
It will brighten our tomorrow, surely

00:22:35.830 --> 00:22:37.540
Kimi ni aitai desu
I want to see you

00:22:37.540 --> 00:22:40.040
Sugoku kantan na koto nan jan ne
That's not a super easy thing, right?

00:22:40.040 --> 00:22:42.790
Hora mijukumono
Hey, the inexperienced

00:22:42.790 --> 00:22:46.540
Seishun believer desu
Are believers in youth.
